<title>USA: Star Technologies ends acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Star Technologies ends acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>STERLING, Va. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Star Technologies Inc said discussions with Electronic Instrumentation and Technology Inc relating to a potential acquisition of that company have been terminated.</p>
<p>Star cited the inability of the two companies to reach agreement on key financial aspects of the acquisition as the cause of the termination, but stressed that the company will aggressively move forward to identify other potential merger/acquisition candidates.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
